      "reviewDate": "3 months ago",
      "localGuideInfo": "Local Guide · 148 reviews",
      "text": "We enjoyed our stay in Xingpingzhen. The village is small and cozy, lots of places to eat out. Everywhere you look, you can see karst mountains, which was the most important thing for us.",
      "scrapedAt": "2026-03-23T07:17:54.766Z"
    },
