      "reviewDate": "9 months ago",
      "localGuideInfo": "Local Guide · 403 reviews",
      "text": "Marketed heavily as a major attraction in the greater Guilin region, but definitely not a must-see after experiencing it in person. If you've already gone to West Street down in Yangshuo, you can pretty much skip Xingping Ancient Town. As it's more of the same thing. Go if you are really curious, but take heed that travelling there is a bit difficult and costly.",
